 "avg_logprob": -0.22464474269321988, "compression_ratio": 1.7095238095238094, "no_speech_prob": 0.004132923670113087}, {"id": 40, "seek": 14788, "start": 157.29999999999998, "end": 160.98, "text": " Therefore, render to Caesar the things that are Caesar's,", "tokens": [50836, 7504, 11, 15529, 281, 26678, 264, 721, 300, 366, 26678, 311, 11, 51020], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22464474269321988, "compression_ratio": 1.7095238095238094, "no_speech_prob": 0.004132923670113087}, {"id": 41, "seek": 14788, "start": 161.54, "end": 164.9, "text": " and to God the things that are God's.", "tokens": [51048, 293, 281, 1265, 264, 721, 300, 366, 1265, 311, 13, 51216], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22464474269321988, "compression_ratio": 1.7095238095238094, "no_speech_prob": 0.004132923670113087}, {"id": 42, "seek": 14788, "start": 165.57999999999998, "end": 169.6, "text": " When they heard it, they marveled, and they left him and went away.", "tokens": [51250, 1133, 436, 2198, 309, 11, 436, 23893, 292, 11, 293, 436, 1411, 796, 293, 1437, 1314, 13, 51451], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22464474269321988, "compression_ratio": 1.7095238095238094, "no_speech_prob": 0.004132923670113087}, {"id": 43, "seek": 14788, "start": 170.54, "end": 174.82, "text": " The same day Sadducees came to him who say that there is no resurrection,", "tokens": [51498, 440, 912, 786, 12269, 769, 384, 279, 1361, 281, 796, 567, 584, 300, 456, 307, 572, 24150, 11, 51712], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22464474269321988, "compression_ratio": 1.7095238095238094, "no_speech_prob": 0.004132923670113087}, {"id": 44, "seek": 14788, "start": 174.82, "end": 177.74, "text": " and they asked him a question, saying,", "tokens": [51712, 293, 436, 2351, 796, 257, 1168, 11, 1566, 11, 51858], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22464474269321988, "compression_ratio": 1.7095238095238094, "no_speech_prob": 0.004132923670113087}, {"id": 45, "seek": 17788, "start": 177.88, "end": 180.94, "text": " Teacher, Moses said,", "tokens": [50365, 19745, 11, 17580, 848, 11, 50518], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22514512803819445, "compression_ratio": 1.7320574162679425, "no_speech_prob": 0.009261797182261944}, {"id": 46, "seek": 17788, "start": 180.94, "end": 183.38, "text": " If a man dies having no children,", "tokens": [50518, 759, 257, 587, 2714, 1419, 572, 2227, 11, 50640], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22514512803819445, "compression_ratio": 1.7320574162679425, "no_speech_prob": 0.009261797182261944}, {"id": 47, "seek": 17788, "start": 183.78, "end": 187.72, "text": " his brother must marry the widow and raise up children for his brother.", "tokens": [50660, 702, 3708, 1633, 9747, 264, 37207, 293, 5300, 493, 2227, 337, 702, 3708, 13, 50857], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22514512803819445, "compression_ratio": 1.7320574162679425, "no_speech_prob": 0.009261797182261944}, {"id": 48, "seek": 17788, "start": 188.48, "end": 191.24, "text": " Now there were seven brothers among us.", "tokens": [50895, 823, 456, 645, 3407, 8452, 3654, 505, 13, 51033], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22514512803819445, "compression_ratio": 1.7320574162679425, "no_speech_prob": 0.009261797182261944}, {"id": 49, "seek": 17788, "start": 191.9, "end": 193.7, "text": " The first married and died,", "tokens": [51066, 440, 700, 5259, 293, 4539, 11, 51156], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22514512803819445, "compression_ratio": 1.7320574162679425, "no_speech_prob": 0.009261797182261944}, {"id": 50, "seek": 17788, "start": 194.01999999999998, "end": 197.2, "text": " and having no children, left his wife to his brother.", "tokens": [51172, 293, 1419, 572, 2227, 11, 1411, 702, 3836, 281, 702, 3708, 13, 51331], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22514512803819445, "compression_ratio": 1.7320574162679425, "no_speech_prob": 0.009261797182261944}, {"id": 51, "seek": 17788, "start": 198.18, "end": 201.56, "text": " So too the second and third, down to the seventh.", "tokens": [51380, 407, 886, 264, 1150, 293, 2636, 11, 760, 281, 264, 17875, 13, 51549], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22514512803819445, "compression_ratio": 1.7320574162679425, "no_speech_prob": 0.009261797182261944}, {"id": 52, "seek": 17788, "start": 202.32, "end": 204.46, "text": " After them all, the woman died.", "tokens": [51587, 2381, 552, 439, 11, 264, 3059, 4539, 13, 51694], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22514512803819445, "compression_ratio": 1.7320574162679425, "no_speech_prob": 0.009261797182261944}, {"id": 53, "seek": 17788, "start": 205.38, "end": 207.22, "text": " In the resurrection, therefore,", "tokens": [51740, 682, 264, 24150, 11, 4412, 11, 51832], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.22514512803819445, "compression_ratio": 1.7320574162679425, "no_speech_prob": 0.009261797182261944}, {"id": 54, "seek": 20722, "start": 207.22, "end": 212.12, "text": " of the seven whose wife will she be, for they all had her.", "tokens": [50365, 295, 264, 3407, 6104, 3836, 486, 750, 312, 11, 337, 436, 439, 632, 720, 13, 50610], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2762038664384322, "compression_ratio": 1.6610878661087867, "no_speech_prob": 0.0018809238681569695}, {"id": 55, "seek": 20722, "start": 212.82, "end": 214.26, "text": " But Jesus answered them,", "tokens": [50645, 583, 2705, 10103, 552, 11, 50717], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2762038664384322, "compression_ratio": 1.6610878661087867, "no_speech_prob": 0.0018809238681569695}, {"id": 56, "seek": 20722, "start": 214.96, "end": 220.24, "text": " You are wrong, because you know neither the scriptures nor the power of God.", "tokens": [50752, 509, 366, 2085, 11, 570, 291, 458, 9662, 264, 29969, 6051, 264, 1347, 295, 1265, 13, 51016], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2762038664384322, "compression_ratio": 1.6610878661087867, "no_speech_prob": 0.0018809238681569695}, {"id": 57, "seek": 20722, "start": 220.84, "end": 225.32, "text": " For in the resurrection they neither marry nor are given in marriage,", "tokens": [51046, 1171, 294, 264, 24150, 436, 9662, 9747, 6051, 366, 2212, 294, 7194, 11, 51270], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2762038664384322, "compression_ratio": 1.6610878661087867, "no_speech_prob": 0.0018809238681569695}, {"id": 58, "seek": 20722, "start": 225.7, "end": 227.44, "text": " but are like angels in heaven.", "tokens": [51289, 457, 366, 411, 18175, 294, 7162, 13, 51376], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2762038664384322, "compression_ratio": 1.6610878661087867, "no_speech_prob": 0.0018809238681569695}, {"id": 59, "seek": 20722, "start": 228.1, "end": 230.1, "text": " And as for the resurrection of the dead,", "tokens": [51409, 400, 382, 337, 264, 24150, 295, 264, 3116, 11, 51509], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2762038664384322, "compression_ratio": 1.6610878661087867, "no_speech_prob": 0.0018809238681569695}, {"id": 60, "seek": 20722, "start": 230.66, "end": 233.28, "text": " have you not read what was said to you by God?", "tokens": [51537, 362, 291, 406, 1401, 437, 390, 848, 281, 291, 538, 1265, 30, 51668], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2762038664384322, "compression_ratio": 1.6610878661087867, "no_speech_prob": 0.0018809238681569695}, {"id": 61, "seek": 20722, "start": 233.78, "end": 235.96, "text": " I am the God of Abraham,", "tokens": [51693, 286, 669, 264, 1265, 295, 17782, 11, 51802], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2762038664384322, "compression_ratio": 1.6610878661087867, "no_speech_prob": 0.0018809238681569695}, {"id": 62, "seek": 20722, "start": 236.38, "end": 237.2, "text": " and the God of Israel,", "tokens": [51823, 293, 264, 1265, 295, 5674, 11, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2762038664384322, "compression_ratio": 1.6610878661087867, "no_speech_prob": 0.0018809238681569695}, {"id": 63, "seek": 23720, "start": 237.2, "end": 237.79999999999998, "text": " and the God of Isaac,", "tokens": [50365, 293, 264, 1265, 295, 22505, 11, 50395], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23297012035663311, "compression_ratio": 1.6680161943319838, "no_speech_prob": 0.005683955270797014}, {"id": 64, "seek": 23720, "start": 238.06, "end": 239.23999999999998, "text": " and the God of Jacob.", "tokens": [50408, 293, 264, 1265, 295, 14117, 13, 50467], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23297012035663311, "compression_ratio": 1.6680161943319838, "no_speech_prob": 0.005683955270797014}, {"id": 65, "seek": 23720, "start": 240.2, "end": 242.23999999999998, "text": " He is not God of the dead,", "tokens": [50515, 634, 307, 406, 1265, 295, 264, 3116, 11, 50617], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23297012035663311, "compression_ratio": 1.6680161943319838, "no_speech_prob": 0.005683955270797014}, {"id": 66, "seek": 23720, "start": 242.67999999999998, "end": 243.64, "text": " but of the living.", "tokens": [50639, 457, 295, 264, 2647, 13, 50687], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23297012035663311, "compression_ratio": 1.6680161943319838, "no_speech_prob": 0.005683955270797014}, {"id": 67, "seek": 23720, "start": 244.61999999999998, "end": 245.88, "text": " And when the crowd heard it,", "tokens": [50736, 400, 562, 264, 6919, 2198, 309, 11, 50799], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23297012035663311, "compression_ratio": 1.6680161943319838, "no_speech_prob": 0.005683955270797014}, {"id": 68, "seek": 23720, "start": 245.89999999999998, "end": 247.67999999999998, "text": " they were astonished at his teaching.", "tokens": [50800, 436, 645, 25687, 4729, 412, 702, 4571, 13, 50889], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23297012035663311, "compression_ratio": 1.6680161943319838, "no_speech_prob": 0.005683955270797014}, {"id": 69, "seek": 23720, "start": 248.33999999999997, "end": 252.16, "text": " But when the Pharisees heard that he had silenced the Sadducees,", "tokens": [50922, 583, 562, 264, 47742, 279, 2198, 300, 415, 632, 3425, 14672, 264, 12269, 769, 384, 279, 11, 51113], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23297012035663311, "compression_ratio": 1.6680161943319838, "no_speech_prob": 0.005683955270797014}, {"id": 70, "seek": 23720, "start": 253.06, "end": 254.07999999999998, "text": " they gathered together,", "tokens": [51158, 436, 13032, 1214, 11, 51209], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23297012035663311, "compression_ratio": 1.6680161943319838, "no_speech_prob": 0.005683955270797014}, {"id": 71, "seek": 23720, "start": 254.2, "end": 255.78, "text": " and one of them, a lawyer,", "tokens": [51215, 293, 472, 295, 552, 11, 257, 11613, 11, 51294], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23297012035663311, "compression_ratio": 1.6680161943319838, "no_speech_prob": 0.005683955270797014}, {"id": 72, "seek": 23720, "start": 256.4, "end": 258.52, "text": " asked him a question to test him.", "tokens": [51325, 2351, 796, 257, 1168, 281, 1500, 796, 13, 51431], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23297012035663311, "compression_ratio": 1.6680161943319838, "no_speech_prob": 0.005683955270797014}, {"id": 73, "seek": 23720, "start": 259.2, "end": 262.2, "text": " Teacher, which is the great commandment in the law?", "tokens": [51465, 19745, 11, 597, 307, 264, 869, 5622, 518, 294, 264, 2101, 30, 51615], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23297012035663311, "compression_ratio": 1.6680161943319838, "no_speech_prob": 0.005683955270797014}, {"id": 74, "seek": 23720, "start": 262.98, "end": 264.09999999999997, "text": " And he said to him,", "tokens": [51654, 400, 415, 848, 281, 796, 11, 51710], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23297012035663311, "compression_ratio": 1.6680161943319838, "no_speech_prob": 0.005683955270797014}, {"id": 75, "seek": 23720, "start": 264.52, "end": 267.09999999999997, "text": " You shall love the Lord your God,", "tokens": [51731, 509, 4393, 959, 264, 3257, 428, 1265, 11, 51860], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23297012035663311, "compression_ratio": 1.6680161943319838, "no_speech_prob": 0.005683955270797014}, {"id": 76, "seek": 26720, "start": 267.8, "end": 269.14, "text": " with all your heart,", "tokens": [50395, 365, 439, 428, 1917, 11, 50462], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2544663687732732, "compression_ratio": 1.6293103448275863, "no_speech_prob": 0.0028425792697817087}, {"id": 77, "seek": 26720, "start": 269.4, "end": 270.86, "text": " and with all your soul,", "tokens": [50475, 293, 365, 439, 428, 5133, 11, 50548], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2544663687732732, "compression_ratio": 1.6293103448275863, "no_speech_prob": 0.0028425792697817087}, {"id": 78, "seek": 26720, "start": 271.09999999999997, "end": 272.53999999999996, "text": " and with all your mind.", "tokens": [50560, 293, 365, 439, 428, 1575, 13, 50632], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2544663687732732, "compression_ratio": 1.6293103448275863, "no_speech_prob": 0.0028425792697817087}, {"id": 79, "seek": 26720, "start": 273.03999999999996, "end": 275.52, "text": " This is the great and first commandment,", "tokens": [50657, 639, 307, 264, 869, 293, 700, 5622, 518, 11, 50781], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2544663687732732, "compression_ratio": 1.6293103448275863, "no_speech_prob": 0.0028425792697817087}, {"id": 80, "seek": 26720, "start": 275.92, "end": 277.42, "text": " and a second is like it.", "tokens": [50801, 293, 257, 1150, 307, 411, 309, 13, 50876], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2544663687732732, "compression_ratio": 1.6293103448275863, "no_speech_prob": 0.0028425792697817087}, {"id": 81, "seek": 26720, "start": 277.92, "end": 280.56, "text": " You shall love your neighbor as yourself.", "tokens": [50901, 509, 4393, 959, 428, 5987, 382, 1803, 13, 51033], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2544663687732732, "compression_ratio": 1.6293103448275863, "no_speech_prob": 0.0028425792697817087}, {"id": 82, "seek": 26720, "start": 281.32, "end": 285.15999999999997, "text": " On these two commandments depend all the law and the prophets.", "tokens": [51071, 1282, 613, 732, 40289, 5672, 439, 264, 2101, 293, 264, 27297, 13, 51263], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2544663687732732, "compression_ratio": 1.6293103448275863, "no_speech_prob": 0.0028425792697817087}, {"id": 83, "seek": 26720, "start": 285.88, "end": 288.74, "text": " Now, while the Pharisees were gathered together,", "tokens": [51299, 823, 11, 1339, 264, 47742, 279, 645, 13032, 1214, 11, 51442], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2544663687732732, "compression_ratio": 1.6293103448275863, "no_speech_prob": 0.0028425792697817087}, {"id": 84, "seek": 26720, "start": 289.18, "end": 292.06, "text": " Jesus asked them a question, saying,", "tokens": [51464, 2705, 2351, 552, 257, 1168, 11, 1566, 11, 51608], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2544663687732732, "compression_ratio": 1.6293103448275863, "no_speech_prob": 0.0028425792697817087}, {"id": 85, "seek": 26720, "start": 292.36, "end": 294.64, "text": " What do you think about the Christ?", "tokens": [51623, 708, 360, 291, 519, 466, 264, 2040, 30, 51737], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2544663687732732, "compression_ratio": 1.6293103448275863, "no_speech_prob": 0.0028425792697817087}, {"id": 86, "seek": 26720, "start": 295.08, "end": 296.59999999999997, "text": " Whose son is he?", "tokens": [51759, 28463, 1872, 307, 415, 30, 51835], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2544663687732732, "compression_ratio": 1.6293103448275863, "no_speech_prob": 0.0028425792697817087}, {"id": 87, "seek": 29720, "start": 297.2, "end": 298.26, "text": " They said to him,", "tokens": [50365, 814, 848, 281, 796, 11, 50418], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21468604324210402, "compression_ratio": 1.6774193548387097, "no_speech_prob": 0.00038897490594536066}, {"id": 88, "seek": 29720, "start": 298.96, "end": 300.03999999999996, "text": " The son of David.", "tokens": [50453, 440, 1872, 295, 4389, 13, 50507], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21468604324210402, "compression_ratio": 1.6774193548387097, "no_speech_prob": 0.00038897490594536066}, {"id": 89, "seek": 29720, "start": 300.88, "end": 302.3, "text": " He said to them,", "tokens": [50549, 634, 848, 281, 552, 11, 50620], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21468604324210402, "compression_ratio": 1.6774193548387097, "no_speech_prob": 0.00038897490594536066}, {"id": 90, "seek": 29720, "start": 303.09999999999997, "end": 305.92, "text": " How is it then that David, in the Spirit,", "tokens": [50660, 1012, 307, 309, 550, 300, 4389, 11, 294, 264, 7218, 11, 50801], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21468604324210402, "compression_ratio": 1.6774193548387097, "no_speech_prob": 0.00038897490594536066}, {"id": 91, "seek": 29720, "start": 306.36, "end": 307.7, "text": " calls him Lord, saying,", "tokens": [50823, 5498, 796, 3257, 11, 1566, 11, 50890], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21468604324210402, "compression_ratio": 1.6774193548387097, "no_speech_prob": 0.00038897490594536066}, {"id": 92, "seek": 29720, "start": 308.2, "end": 309.74, "text": " The Lord said to my Lord,", "tokens": [50915, 440, 3257, 848, 281, 452, 3257, 11, 50992], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21468604324210402, "compression_ratio": 1.6774193548387097, "no_speech_prob": 0.00038897490594536066}, {"id": 93, "seek": 29720, "start": 309.96, "end": 311.18, "text": " Sit at my right hand,", "tokens": [51003, 14523, 412, 452, 558, 1011, 11, 51064], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21468604324210402, "compression_ratio": 1.6774193548387097, "no_speech_prob": 0.00038897490594536066}, {"id": 94, "seek": 29720, "start": 311.52, "end": 313.71999999999997, "text": " until I put your enemies under your feet?", "tokens": [51081, 1826, 286, 829, 428, 7805, 833, 428, 3521, 30, 51191], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21468604324210402, "compression_ratio": 1.6774193548387097, "no_speech_prob": 0.00038897490594536066}, {"id": 95, "seek": 29720, "start": 314.7, "end": 316.94, "text": " If then David calls him Lord,", "tokens": [51240, 759, 550, 4389, 5498, 796, 3257, 11, 51352], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21468604324210402, "compression_ratio": 1.6774193548387097, "no_speech_prob": 0.00038897490594536066}, {"id": 96, "seek": 29720, "start": 317.38, "end": 319.2, "text": " how is he his son?", "tokens": [51374, 577, 307, 415, 702, 1872, 30, 51465], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21468604324210402, "compression_ratio": 1.6774193548387097, "no_speech_prob": 0.00038897490594536066}, {"id": 97, "seek": 29720, "start": 319.71999999999997, "end": 322.9, "text": " And no one was able to answer him a word,", "tokens": [51491, 400, 572, 472, 390, 1075, 281, 1867, 796, 257, 1349, 11, 51650], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21468604324210402, "compression_ratio": 1.6774193548387097, "no_speech_prob": 0.00038897490594536066}, {"id": 98, "seek": 29720, "start": 322.9, "end": 327.03999999999996, "text": " nor from that day did anyone dare to ask him any more questions.", "tokens": [51650, 6051, 490, 300, 786, 630, 2878, 8955, 281, 1029, 796, 604, 544, 1651, 13, 51857], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21468604324210402, "compression_ratio": 1.6774193548387097, "no_speech_prob": 0.00038897490594536066}, {"id": 99, "seek": 32720, "start": 327.2, "end": 330.59999999999997, "text": " Thus the Christ was slain.", "tokens": [50365, 13827, 264, 2040, 390, 1061, 491, 13, 50535], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -3.2867824795009852, "compression_ratio": 1.486842105263158, "no_speech_prob": 0.5684633851051331}, {"id": 100, "seek": 32720, "start": 330.68, "end": 332.88, "text": " We ask such a question of God.", "tokens": [50539, 492, 1029, 1270, 257, 1168, 295, 1265, 13, 50649], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -3.2867824795009852, "compression_ratio": 1.486842105263158, "no_speech_prob": 0.5684633851051331}, {"id": 101, "seek": 32720, "start": 332.96, "end": 336.34, "text": " A question like this is asking God for forgiveness.", "tokens": [50653, 316, 1168, 411, 341, 307, 3365, 1265, 337, 18396, 13, 50822], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -3.2867824795009852, "compression_ratio": 1.486842105263158, "no_speech_prob": 0.5684633851051331}, {"id": 102, "seek": 32720, "start": 336.42, "end": 339.53999999999996, "text": " To get penitence for such a sin,", "tokens": [50826, 1407, 483, 3435, 270, 655, 337, 1270, 257, 3343, 11, 50982], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -3.2867824795009852, "compression_ratio": 1.486842105263158, "no_speech_prob": 0.5684633851051331}, {"id": 103, "seek": 32720, "start": 339.92, "end": 341.56, "text": " is not easy.", "tokens": [51001, 307, 406, 1858, 13, 51083], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -3.2867824795009852, "compression_ratio": 1.486842105263158, "no_speech_prob": 0.5684633851051331}, {"id": 104, "seek": 32720, "start": 341.86, "end": 343.64, "text": " It is an experiment,", "tokens": [51098, 467, 307, 364, 5120, 11, 51187], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -3.2867824795009852, "compression_ratio": 1.486842105263158, "no_speech_prob": 0.5684633851051331}, {"id": 105, "seek": 32720, "start": 344.02, "end": 345.18, "text": " not a poem.", "tokens": [51206, 406, 257, 13065, 13, 51264], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -3.2867824795009852, "compression_ratio": 1.486842105263158, "no_speech_prob": 0.5684633851051331}, {"id": 106, "seek": 32720, "start": 345.64, "end": 347.32, "text": " It is a very bizarre fact.", "tokens": [51287, 467, 307, 257, 588, 18265, 1186, 13, 51371], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -3.2867824795009852, "compression_ratio": 1.486842105263158, "no_speech_prob": 0.5684633851051331}, {"id": 107, "seek": 32720, "start": 347.96, "end": 351.28, "text": " It is presented \u043f\u043e\u044f\u0432only by the people.", "tokens": [51403, 467, 307, 8212, 20011, 25202, 538, 264, 561, 13, 51569], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -3.2867824795009852, "compression_ratio": 1.486842105263158, "no_speech_prob": 0.5684633851051331}, {"id": 108, "seek": 32720, "start": 351.53999999999996, "end": 352.91999999999996, "text": " It is very profound.", "tokens": [51582, 467, 307, 588, 14382, 13, 51651], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -3.2867824795009852, "compression_ratio": 1.486842105263158, "no_speech_prob": 0.5684633851051331}, {"id": 109, "seek": 32720, "start": 353.12, "end": 353.56, "text": " The Bible says,", "tokens": [51661, 440, 6544, 1619, 11, 51683], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -3.2867824795009852, "compression_ratio": 1.486842105263158, "no_speech_prob": 0.5684633851051331}, {"id": 110, "seek": 32720, "start": 353.96, "end": 355.76, "text": " A city with a mountain,", "tokens": [51703, 316, 2307, 365, 257, 6937, 11, 51793], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -3.2867824795009852, "compression_ratio": 1.486842105263158, "no_speech_prob": 0.5684633851051331}, {"id": 111, "seek": 32720, "start": 356.06, "end": 356.91999999999996, "text": " having been built,", "tokens": [51808, 1419, 668, 3094, 11, 51851], "temperature": 1.0, "avg_logprob": -3.2867824795009852, "compression_ratio": 1.486842105263158, "no_speech_prob": 0.5684633851051331}], "language": "English"}